COMPONENT 2: THIRD-PARTY MODEL WEIGHTS
=============================================================================

Sylph is model-agnostic: it runs base model weights that it does not author,
own, or relicense. Each model you choose to run is governed solely by its own
upstream license — for example, the Apache License 2.0, the Llama Community
License, the Gemma Terms of Use, or other terms set by that model's publisher.

The Sylph Public Use License governs ONLY Sylph's original software
(Component 1). It does NOT, and CANNOT, override, restrict, or extend any
rights or obligations attached to third-party model weights. Obtain and use
each model under the terms provided by its publisher.
